{"reviews":[{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-0","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing","x":"I received my Vitamin C serum yesterday after only ordering it on Mon. Fast right? I am grateful for the speedy shipping and how well it was wrapped and protected. Ok, so I applied it last night and this morning and I can honesty say that my skin looks firmer, tighter, brighter and moisturized all from one night of applying it. I look forward to how my skin and aged spots and freckles I've developed as I've aged clear up from using this product. I not looking for miracle but I did buy it to help","h":82,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-1","r":5.0,"t":"My derm is a fan","x":"It takes a lot to impress my dermatologist. She's a fan of my skin after I used this serum!","h":77,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-2","r":5.0,"t":"GAME CHANGER \u2728","x":"I cannot believe how great this stuff is. I\u2019ve only been using for a few days, both morning and night, and I see such a difference in my skin already. I look refreshed like the best night of sleep ever. Game changer for my skin regimen!","h":76,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-3","r":5.0,"t":"Everything is fading","x":"Lines, wrinkles, scars\u2026it's all fading away. Right before my very eyes. What a miracle!","h":72,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-4","r":5.0,"t":"Glowy glowy go go!","x":"Gooooooo GLOW! I don't think I've glowed like this since I was a teenager.","h":72,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-5","r":1.0,"t":"Disappointed","x":"Product leaked and was all dried up. Expired soon as well.","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-6","r":5.0,"t":"Brimming with glee","x":"I don't care how cheezy this sounds: at 71 I am brimming with glee! This dream product is making me look younger.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-7","r":1.0,"t":"I do not recommend.","x":"No it does not work nor does it fade dark spots on the skin.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-8","r":1.0,"t":"I do not recommend.","x":"No it does not work nor does it fade dark spots on the skin.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-9","r":1.0,"t":"Meh....","x":"Not a fan. It\u2019s been over a month and it doesn\u2019t seem like it\u2019s anything anything. Also, it leaves a crusty feeling residue once it dries and I don\u2019t put moisturizer on right after.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-10","r":5.0,"t":"Bargain serum, high-end results","x":"Doesn't this product just prove bargains can work? It isn't expensive yet it's effective!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-11","r":5.0,"t":"Good for hyperpigmentation","x":"My hyperpigmentation was horrendous until I used this serum. Now my skin's tone is even.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-12","r":5.0,"t":"Less makeup here","x":"It is SUCH a relief to use less makeup. I have the serum to thank for that.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-13","r":5.0,"t":"Best serum yet!","x":"Gotta say, this is my best serum to date! Love the Vitamin C content.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-14","r":5.0,"t":"Revitalized skin","x":"Seriously\u2026my skin has never felt this revitalized. I'm in love!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-15","r":5.0,"t":"Tighter d\u00e9colletage","x":"No more saggy neck! Yay! And, my d\u00e9colletage is tighter.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-16","r":1.0,"t":"This Serum Broke Me Out","x":"Such a disappointment. I've never had a C Serum break me out before this one. Its excellent ratings pulled me right in. I just wish I knew which ingredient is the primary culprit.  I'd like to return the serum for a refund, but can't seem to find a way to.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-17","r":5.0,"t":"Rejuvenated skin in my 60s","x":"When you reach your 60s, you kinda give up. This serum restored my faith! My skin is rejuvenated.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-18","r":5.0,"t":"A secret weapon","x":"I so regret not buying this before now. It's a secret weapon against scars!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-19","r":4.0,"t":"snaller than expected","x":"based on the pictures and product description, i was expecting this to be about 2 ounces, but its only 1. It definitely has a scent, some might think it's bad but i don't mind it, it smells kiiind of like weird sunscreen? its a cloudy white color, and ive heard that vitamin c serums can change to be a darker color, so i won't be surprised if that happens. i havent used this long enough to see results, these are just my initial reactions:)","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-20","r":5.0,"t":"Loving it!","x":"Finally, real Vitamin C serum at the right price!  Buy with confidence, light texture, great smell and convenient presentation.  Highly recommended, very satisfied!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-21","r":5.0,"t":"Light and natural","x":"I NEVER use anything but natural products. The ingredients in this are divine! It feels so light as well.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-22","r":5.0,"t":"Lighter hair","x":"This might sound crazy, but I put it in my conditioner. My hair is soft, silky, and the aroma\u2026mmmmmm.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-23","r":5.0,"t":"Lightens everything","x":"I never expected it to lighten my skin. It has though! Even my freckles look less pronounced.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07FFG6TGS-24","r":5.0,"t":"Redefining my face","x":"At the grand old age of 43, I'm redefining my face. My crows feet are sloooowly disappearing.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers report brighter, firmer, more even-toned or younger-looking skin after using the serum.","cites":[1,3,4,5,7,12,13,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers praise the product as effective and a good value for the price.","cites":[2,11,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers say the product did not work for them, including no fading of dark spots.","cites":[8,9,10]},{"text":"One reviewer reports a packaging problem: the product leaked and arrived dried up and near expiry.","cites":[6]},{"text":"One reviewer notes a crusty residue if moisturizer is not applied right after.","cites":[10]}]},"qa":[{"q":"Is it good for sensitive skin?","sec":1.1,"rids":["B07FFG6TGS-7","B07FFG6TGS-8","B07FFG6TGS-1","B07FFG6TGS-23","B07FFG6TGS-11","B07FFG6TGS-14"],"refused":true,"answer":"Not enough evidence in reviews to answer this.","claims":[]},{"q":"Does it really fade dark spots and dark circles?","sec":1.82,"rids":["B07FFG6TGS-8","B07FFG6TGS-7","B07FFG6TGS-23","B07FFG6TGS-3","B07FFG6TGS-11","B07FFG6TGS-12"],"refused":false,"answer":"Reviews disagree: some say it does not fade dark spots [1][2], while others report fading of hyperpigmentation and even skin tone [5] and fading of scars and lines [4]. No review directly addresses dark circles.","claims":[{"text":"Some reviewers say it does not fade dark spots.","cites":[1,2]},{"text":"Other reviewers report hyperpigmentation fading and more even skin tone.","cites":[5]},{"text":"One reviewer reports scars and lines fading.","cites":[4]}]},{"q":"How strong is the vitamin C smell?","sec":1.54,"rids":["B07FFG6TGS-19","B07FFG6TGS-20","B07FFG6TGS-13","B07FFG6TGS-0","B07FFG6TGS-16","B07FFG6TGS-9"],"refused":false,"answer":"Reviews describe the scent differently: one says it \"definitely has a scent\" that smells \"kiiind of like weird sunscreen\" [1], while another calls it a \"great smell\" [2]. Neither review rates how strong the smell is.","claims":[{"text":"One reviewer says it definitely has a scent that smells kind of like weird sunscreen.","cites":[1]},{"text":"Another reviewer describes it as having a great smell.","cites":[2]}]},{"q":"Is it sticky or greasy on the face?","sec":1.12,"rids":["B07FFG6TGS-9","B07FFG6TGS-0","B07FFG6TGS-23","B07FFG6TGS-12","B07FFG6TGS-1","B07FFG6TGS-14"],"refused":true,"answer":"Not enough evidence in reviews to answer this.","claims":[]},{"q":"How long does one bottle last?","sec":0.91,"rids":["B07FFG6TGS-19","B07FFG6TGS-17","B07FFG6TGS-10","B07FFG6TGS-5","B07FFG6TGS-20","B07FFG6TGS-1"],"refused":true,"answer":"Not enough evidence in reviews to answer this.","claims":[]}]}